# Trained bundles — tens of MB. Rebuild with each version's own train command:
#   versions/v4:  python tbt_model.py train <prepared.csv> --fast
#   versions/v5:  python cli.py train <prepared.csv> --fast
# They are build artifacts: they change on every monthly retrain, and git stores
# each version in full since binaries do not delta. Use Releases or Git LFS if
# you need them versioned.
*.joblib

# Data — contains customer names, project names and real pricing. Do not commit.
*.csv
!sample_input.csv

# Generated outputs
audit*.xlsx
scored*.xlsx
*_prepared.csv
synthetic_archive.csv
*.log

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.DS_Store
